00:23:38,137 --> 00:23:38,937
Section twelve.

381
00:23:40,707 --> 00:23:41,247
Loop engineering.

382
00:23:42,757 --> 00:23:45,557
Its purpose is to control transitions around inference.

383
00:23:46,807 --> 00:23:49,507
We need to know when to run, when to

384
